SUMMARY:FYI: Hospice Warehouse sale 
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**Shop with a quasi-professional recycling 
 engineer. (I browse thrift stores)**\nFour Seasons Hospice's next warehous
 e sale will be Friday and Saturday\, Jun 19 & 20th!\nDoors Open at 8:45 a.
 m.\n9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\n561 S Allen Rd\, Flat Rock\nLookin’ for a ‘deal
 ’ on furniture?\nYou’ll find a wide variety of value furniture items a
 t the warehouse. Shop with us each month when we host our 2-day warehouse 
 sales and support the care services of Four Seasons.\nA resale store selli
 ng donated furniture\, home goods\, clothing and other treasures - with al
 l proceeds benefitting Four Seasons Hospice in WNC.\nhttps://fourseasonsfd
 n.org/warehouse-sales/\nhttps://www.facebook.com/HospiceHomeStore\n**This 
 is NOT a hosted event and is posted for informational purposes only.**
