SUMMARY:30th Annual Chalk it Up
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nNarnia Studios presents the annual Chalk It
  Up sidewalk art contest. There will be 150 artists\, both professionals a
 nd novices\, who will create art using chalk on the sidewalks of Main Stre
 et in Hendersonville. The exhibit of chalk art will stay on Main Street un
 til the next rain washes it away.\nRegistration for artists opened June 3 
 to participate in this event\, https://www.narniastudios.com/chalk-it-up\n
 This year\, in honor of our nation’s 250th birthday\, the theme for our 
 annual event is patriotic.\nChalk It Up began with 3 children drawing in f
 ront of their mother’s store. It has blossomed into one of the most belo
 ved and endearing events that our town has to offer. It is a unique way to
  experience beautiful downtown Hendersonville\, N.C.\n**Artists will be fi
 nishing their 'works' closer to 11am.**\n**https://www.hendersonvillenc.go
 v/event/chalk-it-2**\n**https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CukuUwq3rtY&t=89s*
 *\n**Rain dates 7/25 and 8/1.**
