SUMMARY:A Domino Train Wreck Game afternoon
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nYou are convivially invited to an evening o
 f raucous laughter and abandon while playing (a simplified) **Mexican Trai
 n Wreck Dominoes**.\nUp to 16 ppl are welcome to join us.\nThis event is f
 or beginners and/or for those who do NOT take gaming seriously. This is a 
 ‘social’ event.\nThere will be no ‘Book of Hoyle’. There will be n
 o ‘scorekeeping’. Bring yo' funnybone!!\n**ENTRY FEE**: Free\n***Socia
 l hour at 1:30 pm***\nEnjoy a large\, climate-controlled indoor area.\nAss
 t’d beers\, wines\, water & soft drinks available.\nA Mexican Food Truck
  is available\n**You are encouraged to purchase drink at the venue.**\n**O
 ptional:** You may bring (non-messy) finger food. (to share if you like).\
 ngordie's contact: CurmudgeonHiker@gmail.com\n828.393.0297 (text only)
